# 说明: 本仓库是 MemOS 的 DSH fork, 自身没有独立的学术论文。
# 因此 preferred-citation 指向底层记忆系统的 MemOS 论文 —— 这正是使用者应当引用的工作。
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this plugin in academic work, please cite the underlying MemOS papers listed below."
title: "dsh-memos-local: MemOS memory plugin for DeepSeek Harness"
abstract: >-
  A DeepSeek Harness (DSH) fork of the MemOS local memory plugin: layered
  L1/L2/L3 memory, reflection-weighted value backpropagation, cross-task policy
  induction, skill crystallization, and three-tier retrieval.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: steven-stack-s
    # 仅作为 fork 维护者; 上游作者见下方的 preferred-citation / references
repository-code: "https://github.com/steven-stack-s/dsh-memos-local"
url: "https://github.com/steven-stack-s/dsh-memos-local"
license: MIT
